{"architectures":["arm64","x64","x86"],"id":"NextTrace.NTR","latestVersion":"1.7.6","media":{"icons":[],"screenshots":[]},"package":{"description":"An open source light-weight visual traceroute tool implemented by Golang.","documentations":[{"DocumentLabel":"Wiki","DocumentUrl":"https://github.com/nxtrace/NTrace-core/wiki"}],"license":"GPL-3.0","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/nxtrace/NTrace-core/blob/HEAD/LICENSE","locale":"en-US","localizations":{"en-US":{"description":"An open source light-weight visual traceroute tool implemented by Golang.","documentations":[{"DocumentLabel":"Wiki","DocumentUrl":"https://github.com/nxtrace/NTrace-core/wiki"}],"license":"GPL-3.0","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/nxtrace/NTrace-core/blob/HEAD/LICENSE","locale":"en-US","name":"NTR","packageUrl":"https://www.nxtrace.org/","publisher":"NextTrace Community","publisherSupportUrl":"https://github.com/nxtrace/NTrace-core/issues","publisherUrl":"https://www.nxtrace.org/","tags":["as-path","asn-lookup","geoip","geolocation","ip","ip-lookup","network","network-analysis","traceroute"]},"zh-CN":{"description":"一个使用 Golang 实现的开源轻量级可视化 traceroute 工具。","locale":"zh-CN","releaseNotes":"What's Changed\n- 修复 iTerm2 选字时 MTR TUI 旧画面堆叠的问题：实时与回放统一按行更新变化内容，避免连续刷新写入滚动历史，并改善窗口缩放、残行清理和 Unicode 显示 by @tsosunchia in https://github.com/nxtrace/NTrace-dev/pull/257\n- 修复 MTR 探测错误直接写入 stderr 导致交互画面错乱的问题：错误统一显示在 TUI 标题区，暂停时也能更新；收到成功响应或重置统计后清除提示\n- 修复 Windows ARM64 默认 IPv6 探测报错：ICMP、TCP、UDP 在 Traffic Class 为零时跳过系统不支持的 socket 设置，解决 set IPv6 Traffic Class 0: not implemented on windows/arm64 by @KexyBiscuit in https://github.com/nxtrace/NTrace-dev/pull/260\n- 升级至 Go 1.27.3，正式发布、CI 和性能脚本统一使用 Go 默认 JSON 后端，移除 GOEXPERIMENT=nojsonv2 固定配置；继续使用 encoding/json v1 API\n- 改进 CI 专项验收调度：按改动路径选择检查，手动运行或无法读取差异时执行完整验收，保留基础测试、race 和跨平台构建 by @tsosunchia in https://github.com/nxtrace/NTrace-dev/pull/258\n- 更新依赖：go-runewidth v0.0.31、MCP Go SDK v1.8.0、quic-go v0.64.1、table v1.4.1、gjson v1.20.0、x/net v0.61.0 等\n额外的：\nMTR 实时与回放画面按终端宽高显示，窗口较小时可放大查看更多跳；保存报告和会话录制仍保留完整统计。\nWindows ARM64 的修复仅跳过零值 Traffic Class 设置，不代表支持非零 --tos；非零设置失败时仍会返回错误。\n源码构建需要 Go 1.27.3+。对齐正式发布时使用默认 JSON 后端，无需再设置 GOEXPERIMENT=nojsonv2；macOS 最低支持版本仍为 13.0。\nFull Changelog: https://github.com/nxtrace/NTrace-core/compare/v1.7.5...v1.7.6","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/nxtrace/NTrace-core/releases/tag/v1.7.6","tags":["asn查询","as路径","geoip","geolocation","ip","ip查询","traceroute","网络","网络分析"]}},"name":"NTR","packageUrl":"https://www.nxtrace.org/","publisher":"NextTrace Community","publisherSupportUrl":"https://github.com/nxtrace/NTrace-core/issues","publisherUrl":"https://www.nxtrace.org/","tags":["as-path","asn-lookup","geoip","geolocation","ip","ip-lookup","network","network-analysis","traceroute"]},"schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","versions":[{"architectures":["arm64","x64","x86"],"detailPath":"versions/1.7.6/app.json","detailSha256":"383f6a2fabacce1f203a86b6bead958fe631fcfc3c50553e70bb33f74c4fcdc3","releaseDate":"2026-11-06","releaseDateSource":"commit","version":"1.7.6"},{"architectures":["arm64","x64","x86"],"detailPath":"versions/1.7.5/app.json","detailSha256":"2e530c725fbc4ba65133261efbbdadd17b63ecc0cd42e1108b715855a12f20fb","releaseDate":"2026-10-26","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"1.7.5"},{"architectures":["arm64","x64","x86"],"detailPath":"versions/1.7.4/app.json","detailSha256":"39f1e38eea65c1be1c329ef4c54adc86e4cf0f13f24b3680b48eeb1ab502b7f3","releaseDate":"2026-10-11","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"1.7.4"},{"architectures":["arm64","x64","x86"],"detailPath":"versions/1.7.3/app.json","detailSha256":"48fbe263ee529296f62c8b17deee47ddc430dee9158f165ffded2ed7f25b0831","releaseDate":"2026-08-26","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"1.7.3"},{"architectures":["arm64","x64","x86"],"detailPath":"versions/1.7.2/app.json","detailSha256":"a924aa0d8629f9ef67536cc6a6775b6714dbddea5c47ce403ad6a811b38db3aa","releaseDate":"2026-08-13","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"1.7.2"},{"architectures":["ar